Put a dated notice at the top of each file the other patches change.

Our own patch (AvP), applied after all the others. The GNU Library General Public License (2(b)) asks that each
file we change carries a notice saying so, and when. Each notice says which patch changed the file, what it
changed, and where that patch came from. 006-config-file-hardening.patch carries its own notice.

